{"4131140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TheParcelEscape", "steam_appid": 4131140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TheParcel-Escape: Welcome to the daily 'Drug Pickup' and the eternal nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person game centered on <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> and <strong>Puzzle-Escape</strong>. You are a 35-year-old convalescent whose sole daily objective is to go to the parcel station and retrieve your life-sustaining medication. However, upon entry, the ordinary parcel station instantly shifts into one of the independent levels—each a deep-seated memory imbued with a <strong>Chinese Dreamcore aesthetic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore these time-frozen, nostalgic spaces within the sanity time limit, find the hidden clues, solve the bizarre puzzles, ultimately retrieve the <strong>&quot;Parcel Code&quot; on the phone</strong>, unlock the only exit—the parcel locker—and escape to the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've returned to the past, but no one is here anymore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Eerie Beauty of Chinese Dreamcore:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic Chinese settings from the late 90s to the early 00s. From childhood rooms to abandoned bookstores, every step treads on the ruins of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Psychological Dread:</strong> The horror is not driven by cheap Jump Scares, but by a persistent &quot;Sense of Eerie Disconnect&quot; within the scenes—what should be there is silently gone, and what shouldn't be is eerily static.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Pressure of Time and Sanity:</strong> You have a finite Sanity value (Mind value). The passage of time and specific pressure points during puzzle-solving will rapidly deplete it. You must strategically use your medication to buy more time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate and Non-Linear Puzzle Design:</strong> Puzzles are cleverly integrated with nostalgic environmental elements, challenging your observation and logic, avoiding simple, repetitive number locks or block-moving tasks.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TheParcel-Escape: Welcome to the daily 'Drug Pickup' and the eternal nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person game centered on <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> and <strong>Puzzle-Escape</strong>. You are a 35-year-old convalescent whose sole daily objective is to go to the parcel station and retrieve your life-sustaining medication. However, upon entry, the ordinary parcel station instantly shifts into one of the independent levels—each a deep-seated memory imbued with a <strong>Chinese Dreamcore aesthetic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore these time-frozen, nostalgic spaces within the sanity time limit, find the hidden clues, solve the bizarre puzzles, ultimately retrieve the <strong>&quot;Parcel Code&quot; on the phone</strong>, unlock the only exit—the parcel locker—and escape to the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've returned to the past, but no one is here anymore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Eerie Beauty of Chinese Dreamcore:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic Chinese settings from the late 90s to the early 00s. From childhood rooms to abandoned bookstores, every step treads on the ruins of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Psychological Dread:</strong> The horror is not driven by cheap Jump Scares, but by a persistent &quot;Sense of Eerie Disconnect&quot; within the scenes—what should be there is silently gone, and what shouldn't be is eerily static.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Pressure of Time and Sanity:</strong> You have a finite Sanity value (Mind value). The passage of time and specific pressure points during puzzle-solving will rapidly deplete it. You must strategically use your medication to buy more time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate and Non-Linear Puzzle Design:</strong> Puzzles are cleverly integrated with nostalgic environmental elements, challenging your observation and logic, avoiding simple, repetitive number locks or block-moving tasks.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "TheParcel-Escape is a first-person psychological horror puzzle-escape game where you explore Chinese Dreamcore memory scenes, solve bizarre puzzles to find the parcel code, and flee the daily eternal nightmare before your Sanity runs out.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131140/bd9a9b0fa278b7075acf8eb4e6d6eab222f6c3c0/header.jpg?t=1763982676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131140/8efcc713797442ad97ced1bea413a9b8785f7ea6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763982676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131140/8efcc713797442ad97ced1bea413a9b8785f7ea6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763982676", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong>